OL,3,GNEWSAMeet some of Cornwall's
OL,4,Aenvironmental champions
OL,5,
OL,6,FA keen chough-watcher and a National
OL,7,FTrust ranger team are in the running
OL,8,Ffor a BBC Radio Cornwall Make a
OL,9,FDifference Environmental Award.
OL,11,FAlso nominated are a woman who uses her
OL,12,Fhorticultural skills to supporting
OL,13,Fadults with learning disabilities and
OL,14,Fthe team behind the restoration of an
OL,15,Fabandoned water garden and nursery.
OL,17,FThe aim of the Environmental Award is
OL,18,Fto celebrate an individual or group of
OL,19,Fpeople who help to make where they live
OL,20,Fmore environmentally-friendly and
OL,21,Fbetter for nature.
